%A
error[E0419]: an array is not callable in Novis; take a reference with first-class callable syntax instead
%A
error[E0482]: `string` cannot be subscripted
%A
error[E0716]: `*` has no meaning for `string`
%A
error[E0466]: `string` and `int` are disjoint; no value is both, so this comparison is always false
